{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Untrusted: Hackers at Large</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single-player hacking adventure set in the Untrusted universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of the late 1970s in this gritty, story-driven prequel to <i>Untrusted</i>. In <i>Untrusted: Hackers at Large</i>, you'll manage an underground crew of digital operatives in a world where your every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate networks. Exploit vulnerabilities. Control the narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Hacking Mechanics</strong><br>Explore an authentic command-line-inspired interface (with optional mouse-friendly commands). Whether you're into realism or just want to get things done, <i>some typing is required</i>. Read files, exploit vulnerabilities, or use brute force: the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/33b8f3fde208f319e02d37453c9d7728.poster.avif?t=1769705580\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/33b8f3fde208f319e02d37453c9d7728.webm?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/33b8f3fde208f319e02d37453c9d7728.mp4?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew Management Across the Globe</strong><br>Command a network of skilled hackers: coordinate attacks, manage risk, and adapt your strategy as the digital landscape evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/829d6e658dc777d25b056a4d9d3bad53.poster.avif?t=1769705580\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/829d6e658dc777d25b056a4d9d3bad53.webm?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/829d6e658dc777d25b056a4d9d3bad53.mp4?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduction Meets Strategy</strong><br>Analyze systems. Identify weak points. Make decisions that ripple through the storyline and impact your crew\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/8a73a1017a8bb4eca04428198ff772d2.poster.avif?t=1769705580\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/8a73a1017a8bb4eca04428198ff772d2.webm?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/8a73a1017a8bb4eca04428198ff772d2.mp4?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Hacking x Management x RPG Blend</strong><br>A hacking-focused game with some RPG and management elements: tactical gameplay meets narrative-driven decisions in a tight single-player experience.\u00a0<i>You're not just a hacker.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/123c2e6720b4864d582dba449ea371a1.poster.avif?t=1769705580\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/123c2e6720b4864d582dba449ea371a1.webm?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/123c2e6720b4864d582dba449ea371a1.mp4?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in an Alternate Late-70s Timeline</strong><br>Analog paranoia meets digital rebellion where nothing is safe. Immerse yourself in a retro setting where history took a darker turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/9e87469383d50862d73a05690a74f807.poster.avif?t=1769705580\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/9e87469383d50862d73a05690a74f807.webm?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508150/extras/9e87469383d50862d73a05690a74f807.mp4?t=1769705580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack. Don't die. These are the rules.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're into grounded hacking mechanics and high-stakes choices, you\u2019ll feel right at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord</strong> to connect with the community, share strategies, and help shape the future of the Untrusted universe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello underworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508150/071627a44a6e65668e135b450fdf76b84910038f.jpg"},{"name":"Codependency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508150/46e187c4bfa0341aadc7f301d1c0cbb5b127ef31.jpg"},{"name":"1337 808","path":